extends layout

block content
  h1 Exercise Library
  p Search the wger exercise database for movements to add to your training plan.

  form#exercise-search-form
    label(for='exercise-term') Exercise name
    input(type='text' id='exercise-term' name='term' placeholder='e.g. squat, bench press, plank' required)
    button(type='submit') Search

  #exercise-status.status
  #exercise-results.card-grid

  script(src='/javascripts/exercises.js')
